[4.972,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[1;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[1m\u001b[96m 💎 OPAL TUI SHOWCASE ── Slide 1/23: [Welcome to Opal] ── [Overview & Markdown]\u001b[0m                 \u001b[0m\u001b[2;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[3;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[4;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[5;1H  # 💎 Welcome to Opal TUI Framework                                                            \u001b[0m\u001b[6;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[7;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[8;1H  Next-Generation Terminal User Interface & CLI DSL for Crystal                                 \u001b[0m\u001b[9;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[10;1H  Opal unifies the best terminal engineering paradigms into a cohesive framework:               \u001b[0m\u001b[11;1H    • 🍵 The Elm Architecture (TEA) — Pure, predictable state transitions (Bubbletea style).    \u001b[0m\u001b[12;1H    • 🎨 Declarative Fluent Styling & Themes — Lipgloss-inspired styling, 24-bit TrueColor, vi  \u001b[0m\u001b[13;1H    • ⚡ Flicker-Free Delta Rendering — Blessed-inspired double buffering for 60fps smooth upda  \u001b[0m\u001b[14;1H    • 📁 Rich Interactive Components — Multi-field forms, live fuzzy search, file dialogs, and  \u001b[0m\u001b[15;1H    • 📊 Terminal Data Visualizations — Sparklines, bar charts, percentage gauges, and trees.   \u001b[0m\u001b[16;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[17;1H  │ \"Build world-class command-line interfaces with zero external C dependencies.\"              \u001b[0m\u001b[18;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[19;1H  ### 🧭 Presentation Navigation Controls                                                       \u001b[0m\u001b[20;1H    • Press [ESC] or [→] / [n] at any time to advance to the next slide.                        \u001b[0m\u001b[21;1H    • Press [←] or [p] to navigate back to the previous slide.                                  \u001b[0m\u001b[22;1H    • Press [q] to exit this tour and return to your shell.                                     \u001b[0m\u001b[23;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[24;1H                                                                                                \u001b[0m\u001b[25;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\u001b[26;1H\u001b[0m\u001b[97m [ESC / → / n] Next  [← / p] Prev  [q] Quit │ [ESC / →] Next Slide   [q] Quit Demo\u001b[0m              \u001b[0m"]
